<title>USA: San Mateo Cty, Calif., Transit won by BancAmerica.</title>
<headline>San Mateo Cty, Calif., Transit won by BancAmerica.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>BancAmerica said it won $64 million of the San Mateo County, Calif., Transit District bonds, with a true interest cost (TIC) of 4.917 percent.</p>
</text>
